---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | RO Service Support">
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="page-content">
        <p>At RO Service Support, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website or services.</p>
        
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you book a service or fill out a form on our website, we may collect the following information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your Name</li>
          <li>Phone Number</li>
          <li>City / Address</li>
          <li>Details about the service you require</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The information we collect is used solely for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To contact you and schedule a technician visit.</li>
          <li>To provide the requested water purifier repair or installation service.</li>
          <li>To send you updates regarding your service request.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data Protection</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. Your data is kept secure and is only accessible to our authorized team members for the purpose of fulfilling your service request.</p>

        <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites (like Google Maps). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those websites.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@roservicesupport.co.in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>